1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,259
Professional athletes need their bodies to be in excellent condition.

2
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,927
They train hours every day to achieve this.

3
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:23,800
Sometimes it only takes one small mistake to spoil all that hard work.

4
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:30,209
In 2011, for example, French golfer Thomas Levet won the French Open.

5
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:35,306
He was so happy that he jumped in a lake and broke his leg.

6
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:46,380
And American skier Lindsey Vonn cut her hand badly while she was opening a glass bottle to celebrate winning at the 2009 World Championships.

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:54,020
We know you’re not professionals, but we want you to tell us all about your silliest sporting accidents.

8
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:00,151
Last year, I was playing volleyball for my school team.

9
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:03,541
I jumped up high and hit the ball really hard.

10
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:09,602
At first, I thought it was a really good shot, but I soon found out it wasn’t.

11
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:16,300
The ball hit the post at the side of the net: then it hit me in the face and knocked me to the floor.

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,001
I had a big purple bruise on my face and I couldn’t play the rest of the game.

13
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:30,400
When I was 13, I played for the school rugby team and we won the schools championship.

14
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,100
A few days later, there was a big celebration.

15
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:41,720
All the students were there to watch as we walked on to the stage to get medals from the headmistress.

16
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:48,960
I got my medal, but when I was leaving the stage, I tripped and fell down the steps.

17
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:53,800
Luckily, I wasn’t hurt, but I was really, really embarrassed.

18
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:01,740
A few days ago I was skateboarding down my road when I saw my best friend.

19
00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:04,620
I shouted to him and started waving.

20
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:09,521
While I was waving, I rode into a lamppost and fell off.

21
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:13,160
My leg was hurting really badly and I couldn’t move.

22
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:17,080
After ten minutes, my friend called an ambulance.

23
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,140
Finally, they took me to hospital.

24
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,340
The doctor there told me my leg was broken.

25
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:29,820
Now I can’t skateboard for at least six months, and I have to miss the local championships.
